Alembic migrations for MedAnalyser.

The database URL comes from application settings (see app/core/config.py), not
from alembic.ini, so no credentials live in version control.

Run from the `backend/` directory with the virtualenv active:

    alembic upgrade head                        # apply all migrations
    alembic downgrade -1                        # roll back one migration
    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "..."    # create a migration from models
    alembic current                             # show applied revision

Always review autogenerated migrations before committing: Alembic does not
detect every change (e.g. constraint renames, data migrations, index types).
